  "description": "Nyx Farroah, Duke of Roundhill, won the war but lost all hope of being loved, his body left scarred and his heart resigned to solitude. Then his knight brings home a pagan apothecary, Titchte Ranlam—a beautiful woman Nyx never expected. For a man who gave up on being seen, it may be too late to look away.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
